Lists the most recent payments in the current mode, newest first.

Shows the id, outcome, amount, provider, method, and how long ago it was
created. Filter with --status and shorten the list with --limit.

Usage:
  reevit payments list [flags]

Examples:
  reevit payments list
  reevit payments list --status failed --limit 5

Flags:
  -h, --help            help for list
      --limit int       max rows (default 20)
      --status string   filter by status (succeeded, failed, pending, ...)

Global Flags:
      --no-color   disable colour and glyphs
